				>
					Run it without Hermes
				</h2>
				<p class="max-w-3xl font-body text-base leading-relaxed text-bone-newsprint">
					The same compression engine runs as a standalone proxy: point any
					OpenAI-compatible client's
					<code class="font-mono text-base text-weathered-teal">base_url</code> at
					<code class="font-mono text-base text-weathered-teal">http://localhost:9798</code>
					(token) or <code class="font-mono text-base text-weathered-teal">:9797</code>
					(cache), and responses compress over plain HTTP.
				</p>
				<p class="mt-3 max-w-3xl font-body text-base leading-relaxed text-bone-newsprint">
					Invoked without an
					<code class="font-mono text-base text-weathered-teal">aphrodite.toml</code>, the
					binary needs <code class="font-mono text-base text-weathered-teal">--api-key</code> or
					<code class="font-mono text-base text-weathered-teal">APHRODITE_API_KEY</code>. That
					is a startup requirement, not an upstream call - a placeholder is enough to prove
					the binary serves.
				</p>
				<div class="mt-8 overflow-x-auto">
					<table class="w-full border-collapse font-mono text-base">
						<thead>
							<tr class="border-b-2 border-oxblood-dark text-left">
								<th class="py-3 pr-4 text-base font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-stamped-canary">PORT</th>
								<th class="py-3 pr-4 text-base font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-stamped-canary">MODE</th>
								<th class="py-3 text-base font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-stamped-canary">WHAT IT SERVES</th>
							</tr>
						</thead>
						<tbody class="text-bone-newsprint">
							<tr class="border-b border-oxblood-dark">
								<td class="py-3 pr-4 text-bone-white">9797</td>
								<td class="py-3 pr-4 text-weathered-teal">cache</td>
								<td class="py-3">the cache proxy - threshold 2048 bytes by default</td>
							</tr>
							<tr>
								<td class="py-3 pr-4 text-bone-white">9798</td>
								<td class="py-3 pr-4 text-weathered-teal">token</td>
								<td class="py-3">the token proxy - threshold 256 bytes by default</td>
							</tr>
						</tbody>
					</table>
				</div>
				<CodeFence
					Class="mt-8 border border-oxblood-dark"
					Copy
					CopyLabel="PROXY"
					Code={`$ ./aphrodite --api-key «redacted:sk-...» --listen 127.0.0.1:9798
$ curl http://127.0.0.1:9798/health
{"status":"healthy","ccr":true,"mode":"token","version":"<current version>","fill_pct":...}`}
				/>
